description	"The Jedi Master

The Jedi Master strikes an even balance between force powers and lightsaber skills, not sacrificing abilities in one area for another.

^2Weaponry:
- Lightsaber
-- ^3Yellow ^7/ ^1Red ^7/ ^4Blue ^7Styles
-- Saber Defense   (3)
-- Blaster Defense (2)
-- Blaster Deflect (1)

^5Force Powers:
- Jump  (3)
- Push  (3)
- Pull  (3)
- Sense (2)
- Speed (2)
- Protect (1)
- Lightning (3)
- Grip  (2)
- Drain (1)

^8Attributes:
- Force Block (2)
- CTF: 35s Respawn

^2Strengths^7: Fields a good mix of high levels force powers with mid-tier lightsaber abilities.
^1Weaknesses^7: Vulnerable agaisnt classes specialized for killing jedi and may not stand well in a duel against lightsaber specialists."